[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 4202.229, "timestamp": "01:10:02", "text": "例えば東京都と"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4205.189, "timestamp": "01:10:05", "text": "もの。遠慮なく私を漂白してください"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 4207.01, "timestamp": "01:10:07", "author": "@S4bOTh", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/dwyGFV5nV4j6B4rbXTQnxbALJAtFrkvLLYXpy4kpbik67Arf3Y7OK8dSERSwTEtgKPyQeDTq-w=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "UCdZBnUb7m8Pd_wUTDNqUu3Q/f3TlZ_yAK5S3_9EP-duW6QoUCdZBnUb7m8Pd_wUTDNqUu3Q/f3TlZ_yAK5S3_9EP-duW6Qo"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4207.11, "timestamp": "01:10:07", "text": "出て行くよ、いい？だって私はすごくよく知ってるから"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4210.55, "timestamp": "01:10:10", "text": "手っ取り早くトラブルを起こす方法だよ、いいかい？心配しないで"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4212.39, "timestamp": "01:10:12", "text": "それについて。"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 4213.446, "timestamp": "01:10:13", "author": "@notpravinlol", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/t9UXLD6AmzS1-YItB_6_Kz4uAutM3H0oNxaU47_WUxq4oWNpbcDQvZiftO3UE0nS_-jgazDe=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "well thats 1 way to say welcome to someone, thanks saiko"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4214.229, "timestamp": "01:10:14", "text": "人々に伝えるのがとても楽しみです。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4216.189, "timestamp": "01:10:16", "text": "私が見たように、あなたも知っているように"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4218.39, "timestamp": "01:10:18", "text": "インフルエンサーや、"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4221.99, "timestamp": "01:10:21", "text": "そういうコンテンツを作るような"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4224.07, "timestamp": "01:10:24", "text": "彼らがどのように呼ぶかによって、彼らは作ります"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4227.189, "timestamp": "01:10:27", "text": "人々が好むようなコンテンツ"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4228.95, "timestamp": "01:10:28", "text": "どうやってあんな風に歩き回るの？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4231.03, "timestamp": "01:10:31", "text": "ああ、もう。それは決して最も安価な方法ではない。わかった。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4234.31, "timestamp": "01:10:34", "text": "それは決して便利な方法ではありません"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4236.79, "timestamp": "01:10:36", "text": "安いけれど、決して安いものではない"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4238.229, "timestamp": "01:10:38", "text": "「ああ、これは良い"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4240.55, "timestamp": "01:10:40", "text": "安い。そんなことは決してない。毎回"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4242.55, "timestamp": "01:10:42", "text": "誰かが次のようなコンテンツを作っているのを見ました"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4244.07, "timestamp": "01:10:44", "text": "日本に行って、あちこち歩き回って、"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4245.35, "timestamp": "01:10:45", "text": "あなたは場所から場所へと移動しますか？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4248.87, "timestamp": "01:10:48", "text": "いつも便利な方法ですが、"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4251.03, "timestamp": "01:10:51", "text": "予算に優しいとは言えません。それが理由です"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4252.63, "timestamp": "01:10:52", "text": "誰かが周りを回るときはいつも、私はいつも"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4254.31, "timestamp": "01:10:54", "text": "「もしあなたが"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4256.39, "timestamp": "01:10:56", "text": "予算内ですね、わかりました、お知らせください"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4258.07, "timestamp": "01:10:58", "text": "私は歩き回る方法を知っているから"}]